### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register Admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nando Admin",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 3. Login Admin
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token dari response login ke variable
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Get Current Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================
### BAZAAR API
### ==============================================

### 5. Create Bazaar
# @name createBazaar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bazaars
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bazaar Ramadhan 2026",
  "description": "Bazaar akbar kuliner dan fashion nusantara",
  "start_date": "2026-03-01",
  "end_date": "2026-03-31",
  "status": "active"
}

### 6. Get All Bazaars
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bazaars
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Bazaar by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bazaars/1
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================
### OUTLET API
### ==============================================

### 8. Create Outlet under Bazaar 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outlets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bazaar_id": 1,
  "name": "Outlet Hall Utama",
  "code": "OUT-HALL-01",
  "location": "Lobby Utama Lantai 1"
}

### 9. Get All Outlets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outlets
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Outlet by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outlets/1
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================
### CATEGORY API
### ==============================================

### 11. Create Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Minuman Kopi"
}

### ==============================================
### VENDOR API
### ==============================================

### 12. Create Vendor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Senja Express",
  "contact_person": "Andi",
  "phone": "081234567890"
}

### 13. Assign Vendor to Outlet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vendor-outlets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": 1,
  "outlet_id": 1,
  "booth_number": "Booth-A1"
}

### ==============================================
### PRODUCT API
### ==============================================

### 14. Create Product 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "Es Kopi Susu Gula Aren",
  "price": 20000,
  "stock": 50
}

### 15. Create Product 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "Americano Dingin",
  "price": 18000,
  "stock": 30
}

### 16. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================
### TRANSACTION (POS / CHECKOUT) API
### ==============================================

### 17. Create Transaction (Checkout & Deduct Stock)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outlet_id": 1,
  "payment_method": "qris",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "product_id": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 18. Get All Transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 19. Get Transaction by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Get Transaction Summary (Revenue & Count)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================
### TRANSACTION ITEMS & SALES ANALYTICS API
### ==============================================

### 21. Get All Transaction Items (Filter: ?transaction_id=1, ?product_id=1, ?vendor_id=1, ?outlet_id=1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transaction-items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 22. Get Top Selling Products (Leaderboard)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transaction-items/top-selling?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 23. Get Transaction Item Detail by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transaction-items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================
### LOGOUT
### ==============================================

### 24. Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
